41662::$$$message_0324_0000_0000$$$::"Character artist's cartoon series, #2[humming]"::
41663::$$$message_0324_0001_0000$$$::"They're wonderfully adorable, but I don't know about adding in a character from an unrelated game."::
41664::$$$message_0324_0002_0000$$$::"...Are you talking about Caster?"::
41665::$$$message_0324_0003_0000$$$::"Huh? ...Caster!?[cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)] I-I apologize.[br]She looks like such a little girl here..."::
41666::$$$message_0324_0004_0000$$$::"The King of Knights didn't forget to drive the nail into the coffin."::

